    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67648" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆχος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>means, expedient, remedy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.342
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.392
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.181
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.151
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					536
				</span></i>
